Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:03.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}What if you grew one centimeter every minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.71,0:00:05.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.57,0:00:07.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}You stand in your living room.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.40,0:00:09.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}A strange stretch begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.67,0:00:11.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Your shirt pulls tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.28,0:00:13.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Your head rises toward the ceiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.28,0:00:15.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:16.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}One minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.98,0:00:18.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}One centimeter taller.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.91,0:00:19.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}One hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.99,0:00:21.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Sixty centimeters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.63,0:00:24.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}You no longer fit through the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.50,0:00:25.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}One day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.53,0:00:27.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Fourteen point four meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.50,0:00:29.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}You tower over the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.39,0:00:31.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Your bones groan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.04,0:00:34.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Your heart cannot pump blood that high.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.63,0:00:35.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}One week.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.63,0:00:37.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}One hundred meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.08,0:00:38.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}You scrape the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.80,0:00:40.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}The square cube law crushes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.76,0:00:43.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Your weight breaks your legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.43,0:00:45.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}But here's the twist.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.15,0:00:48.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}The tallest human ever was Robert Wadlow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.01,0:00:50.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Two point seven two meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.26,0:00:53.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}His heart failed pushing blood that high.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.58,0:00:55.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Nature sets a hard limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.46,0:00:56.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}About three meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.91,0:00:58.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Then you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.07,0:00:59.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}So remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.22,0:01:01.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Your size is perfect for your design.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.79,0:01:04.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Would you want to grow forever?
